WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.550
[Upbeat music] Astro Andy: Orbit Hop

00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:04.660
One tap. Endless orbits. [Launch and landing sounds]

00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:07.760
Tap on gold for a Perfect. [Rising combo chimes]

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:10.860
Unlock 9 quirky pilots. [Menu taps]

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:16.030
Blaze a trail in style.

00:00:16.030 --> 00:00:18.620
Suit up in Nebula style. [Whoosh]

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:20.810
Tap to hop.
